WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.440 --> 00:12.039
[Episode 1]

3
00:41.320 --> 00:43.119
Typhoon Xianlu, No. 7 of this year

4
00:43.119 --> 00:47.399
landed on the coast of our city at 11:36 this morning.

5
00:47.399 --> 00:48.880
Moving from southeast to west...

6
00:48.880 --> 00:51.199
Falcon Nine Hundred

7
00:51.199 --> 00:54.360
should be able to withstand tropical cyclones.

8
00:54.360 --> 00:57.199
Minglong Group, where business tycoon Zhao Sheng Ge is located,

9
00:57.199 --> 01:00.240
have been carrying out mergers and acquisitions through thunderous means.

10
01:00.240 --> 01:01.479
- Hello. - Wan.

11
01:01.479 --> 01:03.079
The prince is returning to China.

12
01:03.079 --> 01:04.120
How are you preparing for the reception banquet?

13
01:04.120 --> 01:05.439
All ready.

14
01:05.439 --> 01:08.399
When do you and Mr. Tan have time to see it together?

15
01:08.399 --> 01:11.399
No need, I feel most at ease when you handle things.

16
01:11.399 --> 01:15.080
Hey, I heard that he came back with Ms. Xu.

17
01:15.080 --> 01:17.799
No. He came back on his own.

18
01:19.880 --> 01:20.960
Lucas.

19
01:20.960 --> 01:22.080
Tell the legal department

20
01:22.080 --> 01:23.240
to produce a due diligence report of Lychee Bay.

21
01:23.240 --> 01:25.040
Sort it out and send it to me tonight.

22
01:26.279 --> 01:27.279
How do you know?

23
01:27.279 --> 01:29.359
You followed them?

24
01:30.839 --> 01:31.960
I'm not tailing anyone.

25
01:31.960 --> 01:33.759
Just an airport pick-up.

26
01:33.759 --> 01:36.919
Chen Wan, you're really fearless, huh.

27
01:54.720 --> 01:55.960
I'm not worried.

28
01:55.960 --> 01:58.559
Hai City has not been peaceful lately.

29
01:58.559 --> 01:59.839
It's your turn to worry.

30
01:59.839 --> 02:01.400
Aren't you worried about yourself?

31
02:01.400 --> 02:02.439
You've gone out of your way again.

32
02:02.439 --> 02:03.839
Even I may not be able to catch you.

33
02:03.839 --> 02:07.119
It's fine. I'm not planning on anything.

34
02:07.119 --> 02:08.960
Silly boy.

35
02:09.680 --> 02:11.119
You should know.

36
02:11.119 --> 02:12.359
I don't ask for anything.

37
02:12.359 --> 02:14.972
I just want him to be safe and well.

38
02:15.999 --> 02:18.479
After winning that bitter lawsuit,

39
02:18.479 --> 02:20.199
Zhao Sheng Ge rose to fame.

40
02:20.199 --> 02:21.840
A Belgian financial reporter

41
02:21.840 --> 02:25.479
named it the "Golden Act".

42
02:25.479 --> 02:28.120
Sir, I received a few more invitations to the Feng Banquet.

43
02:28.120 --> 02:29.640
Which one will you attend?

44
02:30.560 --> 02:34.880
The one for Shen Zong Nian, Tan You Ming, and Zhuo Zhi Xuan.

45
02:34.880 --> 02:36.200
Got it.

46
02:37.079 --> 02:38.479
You really don't regret it?

47
02:38.479 --> 02:41.240
It's been so long. What's there to regret?

48
02:59.880 --> 03:02.999
There is a situation. Ramp ahead, and an off-road vehicle.

49
03:17.199 --> 03:19.559
I won't let you hurt him.

50
03:41.359 --> 03:43.519
Mr Zhao, there's a white BYD behind.

51
03:43.519 --> 03:45.239
It seems to be helping us.

52
03:45.239 --> 03:47.000
License plate.

53
03:47.000 --> 03:49.120
Mr Zhao, it's raining too hard to see clearly.

54
03:49.120 --> 03:51.359
The tail number seems to be 25.

55
03:51.359 --> 03:53.120
Check it.

56
03:53.120 --> 03:56.040
And over at Baihe Hall.

57
03:56.040 --> 03:57.799
Let Simon and the others deal with it as soon as possible.

58
03:57.799 --> 03:59.120
Sure.

59
04:24.600 --> 04:25.840
Boss.

60
04:25.840 --> 04:27.720
It's a miss.

61
04:27.720 --> 04:30.960
- Got it. - Boss, what do you want me to do?

62
04:32.679 --> 04:35.640
I've been thinking about this for a long time.

63
04:35.640 --> 04:38.119
I want to discuss it with you.

64
04:38.119 --> 04:40.679
It's about the transformation of Baihe Hall.

65
04:40.679 --> 04:42.560
Transformation?

66
04:44.640 --> 04:46.319
Times are different now.

67
04:46.319 --> 04:47.879
Fighting and killing

68
04:47.879 --> 04:50.160
is definitely not a long-term solution.

69
04:50.160 --> 04:52.720
I want to take advantage of the Lychee Bay project

70
04:52.720 --> 04:55.359
to thoroughly clean up Baihe Hall.

71
04:56.239 --> 04:58.960
Do any of the others know about your idea?

72
04:58.960 --> 05:00.679
I haven't told them yet.

73
05:00.679 --> 05:04.039
I wanted to hear your opinion first.

74
05:05.040 --> 05:07.400
I've no objection to the transformation.

75
05:07.400 --> 05:10.559
But I want to win the Lychee Bay project.

76
05:10.559 --> 05:12.520
I'm afraid it's a bit difficult.

77
05:12.520 --> 05:15.119
I heard that the Tan and the Shen family are bound to win.

78
05:15.119 --> 05:16.479
Not to mention,

79
05:16.479 --> 05:19.719
there's Zhao Sheng Ge backing them.

80
05:20.559 --> 05:24.560
What if... I want to cooperate with them?

81
05:25.400 --> 05:28.760
The Crown Prince's reception banquet is rather golden.

82
05:28.760 --> 05:30.840
Seems like it's not just a simple meal.

83
05:30.840 --> 05:32.559
Don't you know who organized this?

84
05:32.559 --> 05:35.640
Tan You Ming, the grandson of the former Chief Secretary for Justice.

85
05:35.640 --> 05:38.280
Shen Zong Nian, a descendant of the stock king.

86
05:38.280 --> 05:40.479
What's more, they're childhood friends.

87
05:40.479 --> 05:41.999
The prince returns to China this time...

88
05:41.999 --> 05:44.720
Mr. Chen, we'll keep this aperitif at 21 degrees.

89
05:44.720 --> 05:45.879
Do you think it's okay?

90
05:45.879 --> 05:47.679
All right.

91
06:28.359 --> 06:31.720
Next, adjust the company's business structure.

92
06:31.720 --> 06:33.799
The customer will come from Shenzhen City.

93
06:33.799 --> 06:36.239
Who do we send to receive them?

94
06:36.239 --> 06:37.239
Sure.

95
06:37.239 --> 06:38.760
Leave it to me.

96
06:40.960 --> 06:43.640
Mr. Chen, this is tonight's wine menu.

97
06:43.640 --> 06:44.679
Please take a look.

98
06:44.679 --> 06:45.799
If there is no problem,

99
06:45.799 --> 06:48.239
the kitchen can start preparing.

100
06:48.239 --> 06:49.919
Okay, let me take a look.

101
06:52.600 --> 06:53.679
- No problem. - Okay.

102
06:53.679 --> 06:54.799
The temperature can be lowered a little.

103
06:54.799 --> 06:56.359
Wait until the guests have arrived before serving the wine.

104
06:56.359 --> 06:58.760
No need to decant the wine. 70 percent is enough.

105
07:02.160 --> 07:03.479
Long time no see, Mr. Chen.

106
07:03.479 --> 07:05.200
- How have you been? - Good.

107
07:05.200 --> 07:06.999
Bye.

108
07:06.999 --> 07:08.280
Wan.

109
07:08.280 --> 07:10.279
Zhao Sheng Ge is coming soon.

110
07:12.400 --> 07:14.160
It's time, too.

111
07:14.160 --> 07:15.560
He is always punctual.

112
07:15.560 --> 07:16.560
Hey.

113
07:16.560 --> 07:18.999
Listen, tonight is the perfect opportunity.

114
07:18.999 --> 07:20.999
Do you think these people are here to eat?

115
07:20.999 --> 07:24.039
They've come with the intention of making friends with Zhao Sheng Ge.

116
07:25.040 --> 07:27.520
Mr. Zhao's status dictates.

117
07:28.160 --> 07:30.520
Why can't you understand what I mean?

118
07:30.520 --> 07:31.720
Mr. Zhao is here.

119
07:31.720 --> 07:33.280
Mr. Zhao.

120
07:33.280 --> 07:34.879
Mr. Zhao.

121
07:34.879 --> 07:36.599
- Hello. - Mr. Zhao.

122
07:52.720 --> 07:54.119
Good evening.

123
07:54.119 --> 07:55.600
Sorry for the wait.

124
07:55.600 --> 07:57.280
Everyone.

125
07:57.280 --> 07:58.640
Haven't seen you for a long time.

126
07:58.640 --> 07:59.799
Mr. Zhao, long time no see.

127
07:59.799 --> 08:00.999
Long time no see, Mr. Zhao.

128
08:00.999 --> 08:02.559
Hello, Mr. Zhao. Long time no see.

129
08:02.559 --> 08:03.720
Mr. Zhao.

130
08:03.720 --> 08:05.479
Mr. Zhao.

131
08:05.479 --> 08:06.999
Mr. Zhao, you must be tired from traveling.

132
08:06.999 --> 08:08.040
Take care.

133
08:08.040 --> 08:09.879
Thank you for coming, Mr. Zhao.

134
08:09.879 --> 08:12.520
There has been a lot of turmoil in Hai City lately.

135
08:12.520 --> 08:14.160
It's fun to ride the wind and waves.

136
08:14.160 --> 08:15.600
You don't disappoint.

137
08:15.600 --> 08:16.840
I'm used to big winds and waves.

138
08:16.840 --> 08:18.840
I hope to have the opportunity to cooperate with you.

139
08:18.840 --> 08:20.479
Good to meet again.

140
08:24.879 --> 08:26.919
Go say hello.

141
08:26.919 --> 08:28.359
No need.

142
08:31.160 --> 08:32.640
Excuse me, Mr. Chen.

143
08:32.640 --> 08:35.555
The chef said the batch of mangoes from the Vietnam border

144
08:35.555 --> 08:36.919
was delayed due to typhoon.

145
08:36.919 --> 08:39.400
Neither poplar nectar nor pudding can be made.

146
08:39.400 --> 08:43.119
Is it okay to replace the dessert with red bean soup?

147
08:44.760 --> 08:47.440
Mr. Tan, will you come to my birthday next Friday?

148
08:47.440 --> 08:49.719
Wow, no one else can even reach you.

149
08:49.719 --> 08:51.559
Sure.

150
08:51.559 --> 08:53.079
Come over.

151
08:53.079 --> 08:54.560
Mr. Shen.

152
09:02.959 --> 09:04.679
Sorry, I've to leave for a moment.

153
09:04.679 --> 09:06.560
Okay, see you next time.

154
09:17.360 --> 09:19.319
Turn the air conditioner down again.

155
09:19.319 --> 09:20.719
- Just 1 to 1.5 degrees colder. - Got it.

156
09:20.719 --> 09:21.959
Turn dehumidification on, too. Thanks.

157
09:21.959 --> 09:23.399
No problem.

158
09:38.000 --> 09:40.240
What's this? Never seen it before.

159
09:40.240 --> 09:42.319
This is specially arranged by Mr. Chen.

160
09:42.319 --> 09:45.320
Pennywort and raw rehmannia herbal tea.

161
09:46.760 --> 09:47.799
Try it.

162
09:47.799 --> 09:49.200
Not bad.

163
09:52.880 --> 09:54.520
Nice, it's been very dry lately.

164
09:54.520 --> 09:55.640
Drinking this is good.

165
09:55.640 --> 09:56.925
Nian Zi, drink more.

166
09:56.925 --> 09:58.935
Let's raise some toasts.

167
10:13.480 --> 10:15.839
Sheng, this is Chen Wan.

168
10:15.839 --> 10:17.160
Boss, I've tracked them down.

169
10:17.160 --> 10:19.560
The owner of the car is a man named Chen Wan.

170
10:29.520 --> 10:31.040
Hello.

171
10:32.000 --> 10:34.599
Mr. Zhao, nice to meet you.

172
10:35.880 --> 10:39.599
Today's banquet was organized by Chen Wan alone.

173
10:39.599 --> 10:40.839
Sheng.

174
10:40.839 --> 10:43.120
You've been using your chopsticks a lot today.

175
10:43.120 --> 10:44.319
You finished the wine,

176
10:44.319 --> 10:45.959
and even the tea.

177
10:45.959 --> 10:47.840
The food must be to your taste.

178
10:49.319 --> 10:51.799
You're not easy to handle.

179
10:51.799 --> 10:54.400
Wan, let's go bowling tomorrow.

180
10:54.400 --> 10:56.079
The eastern line of the light rail at the border is finally coming to fruition.

181
10:56.079 --> 10:58.040
I'll take Sheng to take a look.

182
10:58.040 --> 11:00.439
Hollywood Mansion is just across the bridge.

183
11:00.439 --> 11:02.199
You can wait until the typhoon passes the day after tomorrow.

184
11:02.199 --> 11:03.880
Let's go there to play ball and camp together.

185
11:03.880 --> 11:05.400
The scenery is beautiful.

186
11:05.400 --> 11:06.959
Yes.

187
11:06.959 --> 11:08.360
This damn weather.

188
11:08.360 --> 11:10.079
Wan, you're still thoughtful.

189
11:10.079 --> 11:12.319
I'll ask the manager to serve more tea.

190
11:12.319 --> 11:14.239
Let's talk slowly, everyone.

191
11:19.360 --> 11:21.040
You've got this.

192
11:21.040 --> 11:22.079
Sheng.

193
11:22.079 --> 11:23.719
Wan's a fine man.

194
11:23.719 --> 11:25.680
Don't worry.

195
11:27.640 --> 11:30.080
Shen Zong Nian, say something.

196
11:30.880 --> 11:32.359
Rest assured.

197
11:33.240 --> 11:35.480
But I didn't say anything?

198
11:35.480 --> 11:38.920
You're lucky if I don't get mad after talking to you two.

199
11:42.839 --> 11:44.360
Okay, let's go now.

200
11:44.360 --> 11:46.320
- See you later. - Bye.

201
11:49.760 --> 11:51.160
Wan.

202
11:51.160 --> 11:53.079
Are you going to Lan Kwai Fong tonight?

203
11:53.079 --> 11:55.120
There are still some guests who have not left.

204
11:55.120 --> 11:56.120
I won't go.

205
11:56.120 --> 11:57.520
A pity.

206
11:57.520 --> 11:58.880
Lychee Bay...

207
11:58.880 --> 12:01.160
Let the legal department review the property rights chain again.

208
12:01.160 --> 12:03.160
There was a problem with the previous due diligence.

209
12:03.160 --> 12:04.439
One more thing.

210
12:04.439 --> 12:07.959
Keep an eye on Mai Jia Hui's Baihe Hall.

211
12:07.959 --> 12:09.839
See you soon.

212
12:09.839 --> 12:11.160
That's all.

213
12:28.959 --> 12:30.280
There's a white BYD behind.

214
12:30.280 --> 12:32.080
It seems to be helping us.

215
12:32.760 --> 12:34.920
Chen Wan.

216
12:53.199 --> 12:54.879
Stop!

217
12:56.280 --> 12:58.679
You've been back for a few days.

218
12:58.679 --> 13:00.959
But only now do I know.

219
13:00.959 --> 13:04.240
Do you still have the Zhao family in your heart?

220
13:04.240 --> 13:07.200
You pay less and less attention to me.

221
13:09.319 --> 13:11.599
Don't forget.

222
13:11.599 --> 13:14.079
Everything you have now

223
13:14.079 --> 13:16.320
was given by the Zhao family.

224
13:17.640 --> 13:19.360
You're heartless, huh.

225
13:19.360 --> 13:22.120
Don't you just want me to be inhumane?

226
13:22.120 --> 13:23.359
You...

227
14:08.599 --> 14:12.160
Sir, Chen Wan's personal information has been sent to your email.

228
14:35.520 --> 14:39.280
I think everyone knows the purpose the meeting today.

229
14:39.280 --> 14:41.199
Big Bro, what do we do now?

230
14:41.199 --> 14:42.439
Don't worry.

231
14:42.439 --> 14:45.439
I want to hear everyone's opinions first.

232
14:45.439 --> 14:48.839
After all, Baihe Hall isn't mine alone.

233
14:48.839 --> 14:50.760
I listen to the boss.

234
14:50.760 --> 14:53.079
I'm just the second in command..

235
14:53.079 --> 14:56.719
You're the leader chosen by us.

236
14:59.559 --> 15:00.959
Boss.

237
15:00.959 --> 15:03.480
I'm just in charge of Baihe Hall's finances.

238
15:03.480 --> 15:05.160
Someone responsible for managing money.

239
15:05.160 --> 15:07.000
Fighting and killing?

240
15:07.000 --> 15:09.359
I can't do it.

241
15:10.120 --> 15:11.159
Good.

242
15:11.159 --> 15:13.799
Then I'll tell you what I think.

243
15:13.799 --> 15:16.679
The Tan family is gentle in things.

244
15:16.679 --> 15:17.959
But the Zhao family?

245
15:17.959 --> 15:20.480
Especially now with Zhao Sheng Ge...

246
15:20.480 --> 15:22.760
Both tough and gentle.

247
15:22.760 --> 15:24.360
More ruthless than Zhao Mao Zheng.

248
15:24.360 --> 15:26.679
Instead of being tough with them,

249
15:26.679 --> 15:28.439
it's better to go with the flow.

250
15:28.439 --> 15:30.719
We can do him a favor

251
15:30.719 --> 15:33.240
in exchange for longer-term benefits.

252
15:33.240 --> 15:36.439
Interest is interest.

253
15:36.439 --> 15:39.920
But whose long-term interests are these?

254
15:41.400 --> 15:42.640
With the Lychee Bay area,

255
15:42.640 --> 15:44.839
when there is a typhoon, there will be floods.

256
15:44.839 --> 15:46.126
It would be better to think

257
15:46.126 --> 15:48.559
about borrowing the help of the Zhaos and the Tans.

258
15:48.559 --> 15:51.160
Let your subordinates and family

259
15:51.160 --> 15:52.880
have better living conditions.

260
15:52.880 --> 15:54.400
Wouldn't that be nicer?

261
15:54.400 --> 15:55.999
Don't you agree?

262
15:57.599 --> 15:59.360
Full of benevolence and morality.

263
15:59.360 --> 16:01.879
All my subordinates are plotting.

264
16:02.520 --> 16:04.240
Don't worry.

265
16:04.240 --> 16:05.640
The news just came out.

266
16:05.640 --> 16:07.240
Things aren't set in stone yet.

267
16:07.240 --> 16:09.920
Wait for me to get in touch.

268
16:11.040 --> 16:13.880
I hope you can open the way to life and death.

269
16:13.880 --> 16:18.120
I'll send you to hell.

270
16:18.120 --> 16:20.480
The leader of Baihe Hall lies dead on the street.

271
16:20.480 --> 16:22.559
The soul-grabbing phone call is suspected to come from Minglong's young lad.

272
16:22.559 --> 16:25.280
I heard that Minglong is going to invest in the Lychee Bay project.

273
16:25.280 --> 16:27.120
The Tan family has taken a back seat.

274
16:27.120 --> 16:28.799
As soon as he took over, he killed Mai Jia Hui.

275
16:28.799 --> 16:31.639
Murder for a piece of land!

276
16:32.280 --> 16:33.799
Come in.

277
16:33.799 --> 16:35.199
Where did you go yesterday?

278
16:35.199 --> 16:37.280
How can the boss be absent for such an important patent meeting?

279
16:37.280 --> 16:39.000
That's outrageous.

280
16:39.000 --> 16:40.439
I believe in your ability.

281
16:40.439 --> 16:41.959
It can be done.

282
16:41.959 --> 16:43.679
Don't give me that nonsense.

283
16:43.679 --> 16:45.760
I was deceived by your smile at first.

284
16:45.760 --> 16:47.680
Got on the pirate ship.

285
16:48.360 --> 16:51.000
Right. Mr. Zhou replied.

286
16:51.000 --> 16:52.880
He said he would like to get together with you.

287
16:52.880 --> 16:54.599
Okay. You can arrange things.

288
16:54.599 --> 16:57.839
Any other time except the night after tomorrow.

289
16:57.839 --> 17:00.200
Except the night after tomorrow?

290
17:05.240 --> 17:07.360
Darling, the Ghost Festival starts today.

291
17:07.360 --> 17:09.599
Remember to come home for dinner.

292
17:45.359 --> 17:47.199
No.

293
17:48.440 --> 17:49.479
Is it him?

294
17:49.479 --> 17:51.960
The Chen family took him in when he was nine years old.

295
17:51.960 --> 17:55.520
He lived in the kennel in the yard for a year and a half.

296
17:55.520 --> 17:57.040
So pitiful.

297
17:57.040 --> 17:58.200
I heard he is mentally ill.

298
17:58.200 --> 17:59.839
Even pierced someone else's palm.

299
17:59.839 --> 18:02.040
He was imprisoned for three years.

300
18:02.040 --> 18:04.760
He was released when he was twelve years old.

301
18:04.760 --> 18:06.080
Hello.

302
18:07.760 --> 18:09.399
Address the elders.

303
18:09.399 --> 18:11.359
Good morning.

304
18:11.359 --> 18:12.879
Go on.

305
18:18.599 --> 18:19.599
Who is it?

306
18:19.599 --> 18:21.520
Mom, it's me.

307
18:23.760 --> 18:25.359
Darling.

308
18:25.359 --> 18:26.919
Come in,

309
18:35.720 --> 18:37.159
Where is the thing?

310
18:39.000 --> 18:42.599
You can't blame me entirely.

311
18:42.599 --> 18:45.000
Cao Zhi deducted my dividends.

312
18:45.000 --> 18:46.639
Liu made a fortune at the card table again.

313
18:46.639 --> 18:48.200
Scammed me out of a Bulgari set.

314
18:48.200 --> 18:50.359
Drives me crazy.

315
18:52.000 --> 18:54.079
Can't you move out?

316
18:54.079 --> 18:55.240
You can live wherever you want.

317
18:55.240 --> 18:56.799
A villa or a duplex!

318
18:56.799 --> 18:58.799
As for him...

319
18:58.799 --> 19:01.799
Can't you tell him?

320
19:01.799 --> 19:03.559
I won't leave.

321
19:03.559 --> 19:04.760
Not until we get what's ours.

322
19:04.760 --> 19:05.960
I'll just die here.

323
19:05.960 --> 19:07.040
Even if you die here,

324
19:07.040 --> 19:08.359
he won't give it to you either.

325
19:08.359 --> 19:10.359
I'll take it myself then.

326
19:10.359 --> 19:11.879
It's been so many years.

327
19:11.879 --> 19:13.760
Why can't you still understand?

328
19:13.760 --> 19:15.119
Darling.

329
19:15.119 --> 19:16.639
Mom only has you.

330
19:16.639 --> 19:18.520
You have to be more ambitious.

331
19:18.520 --> 19:20.520
Okay?

332
19:20.520 --> 19:22.200
Listen.

333
19:22.200 --> 19:25.240
Recently, Xie Jia Jian is dating me.

334
19:25.240 --> 19:27.480
You can't do that.

335
19:30.319 --> 19:31.639
How much do you want?

336
19:31.639 --> 19:34.199
I can earn it and give it to you.

337
19:39.040 --> 19:40.920
He is a family man.

338
19:40.920 --> 19:43.680
He isn't sincere to you.

339
19:43.680 --> 19:45.760
What sincerity?

340
19:45.760 --> 19:48.000
I just went to have a meal with him.

341
19:48.000 --> 19:50.280
See if he can do anything...

342
19:50.280 --> 19:51.960
to help you get into Rongxin.

343
19:51.960 --> 19:53.920
After all, it's your father's property.

344
19:53.920 --> 19:55.079
I won't get into Rongxin.

345
19:55.079 --> 19:56.680
I've my own things to do.

346
19:56.680 --> 19:59.639
What can you do?

347
19:59.639 --> 20:00.799
Darling.

348
20:00.799 --> 20:03.240
I'm so worried about you.

349
20:03.240 --> 20:04.319
How many years since you graduated?

350
20:04.319 --> 20:07.000
We haven't even entered the branch door yet.

351
20:07.000 --> 20:10.599
I miss you all night and can't sleep well.

352
20:10.599 --> 20:12.720
Then don't worry about me anymore.

353
20:12.720 --> 20:13.799
Got it?

354
20:13.799 --> 20:14.960
Take care of yourself.

355
20:14.960 --> 20:18.159
Worry about yourself, okay?

356
20:18.159 --> 20:20.000
Fine.

357
20:21.319 --> 20:24.000
Is the money I gave you enough?

358
20:24.000 --> 20:25.040
Fourth Madam.

359
20:25.040 --> 20:26.480
Master wants you to go down and pay respects.

360
20:26.480 --> 20:27.920
Okay, coming.

361
20:27.920 --> 20:29.879
Go on, your dad wants you.

362
20:29.879 --> 20:31.119
Come on.

363
21:10.839 --> 21:12.040
Chen Yu.

364
21:12.040 --> 21:15.480
You will start working at Rongxin next week.

365
21:15.480 --> 21:16.720
When working in the company,

366
21:16.720 --> 21:18.440
remember to take the initiative.

367
21:18.440 --> 21:21.040
Don't make others push you.

368
21:21.040 --> 21:24.200
- Be polite. - Don't worry, I know this best.

369
21:24.200 --> 21:25.280
Right, Mom.

370
21:25.280 --> 21:26.440
Two days ago,

371
21:26.440 --> 21:30.319
Mr. Liao and I took a fancy to a piece of land in Ma Ge Tang.

372
21:30.319 --> 21:31.960
We're going to make a...

373
21:31.960 --> 21:33.639
To be precise, it's for the Liao family.

374
21:33.639 --> 21:36.240
We want to build a commercially integrated neighborhood.

375
21:36.240 --> 21:38.000
I think in the whole family,

376
21:38.000 --> 21:39.119
only dad can do it.

377
21:39.119 --> 21:41.480
I specifically consulted a Feng Shui master.

378
21:41.480 --> 21:43.599
This land's future is prosperous.

379
21:43.599 --> 21:47.399
After taking it, Rongxin's share price can at least double.

380
21:48.660 --> 21:50.720
- That's a good thing. - Don't talk about work while eating.

381
21:50.720 --> 21:52.559
Eat more.

382
21:52.559 --> 21:54.866
Dad. You eat, too.

383
21:54.866 --> 21:56.800
Dad, I heard

384
21:56.800 --> 21:59.760
that Zhao Sheng Ge from the Zhao family came back two days ago.

385
21:59.760 --> 22:02.520
The prince arranged a reception banquet.

386
22:02.520 --> 22:05.159
Why didn't our family get an invitation?

387
22:05.159 --> 22:10.199
My dad is still a respectable person here.

388
22:12.000 --> 22:15.799
You still need me to teach you about such things?

389
22:15.799 --> 22:17.920
Sorry, Dad.

390
22:17.920 --> 22:20.599
The prince has been dealing with US dollars for several years.

391
22:20.599 --> 22:24.559
Maybe he no longer appreciates this three-acre land in Shanghai.

392
22:24.559 --> 22:27.760
It's getting even more outrageous than before.

393
22:29.920 --> 22:31.560
Don't talk nonsense!

394
22:32.520 --> 22:35.799
No matter how powerful you are, you still have to start a family here.

395
22:35.799 --> 22:39.040
As long as the ladies put some thought into it,

396
22:39.040 --> 22:41.000
we're really hit the jackpot.

397
22:41.000 --> 22:44.439
That's more than just walking around.

398
22:47.920 --> 22:50.000
Wan, why have you lost so much weight recently?

399
22:50.000 --> 22:52.599
Is the food not to your liking?

400
22:52.599 --> 22:54.399
No, definitely not.

401
22:54.399 --> 22:55.639
The weather is too hot.

402
22:55.639 --> 22:57.480
I just have no appetite.

403
22:57.480 --> 22:59.119
That's for sure.

404
22:59.119 --> 23:01.240
Wan spends the whole day with the young master of the Zhuo family.

405
23:01.240 --> 23:02.399
They have meals together.

406
23:02.399 --> 23:06.679
If you're used to eating the best banquets, why would you like this?

407
23:06.679 --> 23:08.040
Wan.

408
23:08.040 --> 23:11.440
Mr. Zhuo is with the prince every day, right?

409
23:11.440 --> 23:13.639
If you have a chance to climb up,

410
23:13.639 --> 23:15.280
give it more thought.

411
23:15.280 --> 23:16.760
Consider the Chen family.

412
23:16.760 --> 23:17.839
How am I qualified?

413
23:17.839 --> 23:20.599
I'm just helping Mr. Zhuo drive his car.

414
23:20.599 --> 23:22.760
What can he hope for?

415
23:23.520 --> 23:26.359
They just use him as an errand boy.

416
23:26.359 --> 23:28.359
Do you really think they'd care about him?

417
23:29.720 --> 23:31.919
Sir, the auspicious time has come.

418
23:36.000 --> 23:37.039
Heaven and Earth, Yin and Yang.

419
23:37.039 --> 23:38.040
All living beings.

420
23:38.040 --> 23:40.159
According to the imperial decree of the founder of Maoshan,

421
23:40.159 --> 23:42.000
come forth, Lord Sanmao.

422
23:42.000 --> 23:43.839
Let symbols and fragrance guide.

423
23:43.839 --> 23:46.000
May Zhao Yun quickly appear here.

424
23:46.000 --> 23:48.359
Swift as the law.

425
23:58.680 --> 24:00.119
The sky is clear and the earth is clear. All ghosts return to the underworld.

426
24:00.119 --> 24:03.919
Today, there is the Chen family. Let the heavens work swift.

427
24:16.280 --> 24:17.680
The sky is clear and the earth is clear. All ghosts return to the underworld.

428
24:17.680 --> 24:19.440
Let the heavens work swift.

429
24:19.440 --> 24:22.240
Let the heavens work swift.

430
24:36.280 --> 24:39.760
A dog should look like a dog.

431
24:58.119 --> 24:59.520
Wan.

432
25:01.040 --> 25:02.599
It's me.

433
25:02.599 --> 25:05.079
Put the knife down first.

434
25:05.079 --> 25:06.839
So what if it's you?

435
25:06.839 --> 25:08.599
I just haven't seen you for a long time.

436
25:08.599 --> 25:10.840
I want to chat with you.

437
25:11.480 --> 25:13.000
Everything will be good if the family is harmonious, right?

438
25:13.000 --> 25:16.159
Brother-in-law is talking about you again.

439
25:16.159 --> 25:17.839
So what if he sees it?

440
25:17.839 --> 25:20.680
Do you think you can still send me to Xiaolan Mountain?

441
25:20.680 --> 25:21.920
Listen.

442
25:21.920 --> 25:23.240
You can't do it anymore.

443
25:23.240 --> 25:27.280
But I... can cut your fingers again.

444
25:28.760 --> 25:29.920
Say it.

445
25:29.920 --> 25:32.800
Which finger will you sacrifice this time?

446
26:57.799 --> 26:59.119
Hello.

447
26:59.119 --> 27:00.800
Good evening, Mr. Chen.

448
27:03.480 --> 27:04.920
Monica.

449
27:04.920 --> 27:07.079
Sorry to bother you so late.

450
27:07.079 --> 27:09.879
You didn't come for the follow-up consultation last week.

451
27:09.879 --> 27:13.280
And the prescription I prescribed can't be used continuously.

452
27:13.280 --> 27:16.119
So, I've to give you a call.

453
27:16.879 --> 27:18.960
Sorry, Monica.

454
27:18.960 --> 27:20.920
I didn't show up.

455
27:20.920 --> 27:23.599
I'll pay the compensation fee.

456
27:23.599 --> 27:25.119
It's my problem.

457
27:25.119 --> 27:27.599
Mr. Chen, that's not what I meant.

458
27:27.599 --> 27:29.799
Are you free these two days?

459
27:29.799 --> 27:32.359
Can you try to find some time to come over for a face-to-face consultation?

460
27:32.359 --> 27:34.240
This stage of treatment is quite special.

461
27:34.240 --> 27:36.080
It's better to keep it going.

462
27:36.879 --> 27:38.879
If you're available...

463
27:39.680 --> 27:41.240
can I go over now?

464
27:42.079 --> 27:43.639
Hello, Zhao Sheng Ge.

465
27:43.639 --> 27:45.000
Have you watched the news?

466
27:45.000 --> 27:47.000
No time to watch.

467
27:47.000 --> 27:48.240
Mai Jia Hui is dead.

468
27:48.240 --> 27:49.680
Jumped to death.

469
27:49.680 --> 27:53.119
Everyone on the internet is saying it was you.

470
27:53.119 --> 27:54.680
Was it you?

471
27:54.680 --> 27:56.480
If it were me...

472
27:56.480 --> 27:59.520
I would've made him disappear without a trace.

473
28:05.319 --> 28:07.920
I punctured their veins.

474
28:07.920 --> 28:10.119
Right finger amputated.

475
28:10.119 --> 28:12.800
Even dogs wouldn't eat their bones.

476
28:14.960 --> 28:17.679
Hurry up! After him! He's run to the orphanage!

477
28:31.219 --> 28:33.041
Stop!

478
28:34.218 --> 28:37.514
Over there! Get him!

479
29:19.274 --> 29:22.589
Mr. Zhao, the charity banquet will start soon.

480
29:26.895 --> 29:28.162
I need to leave.

481
29:28.162 --> 29:31.025
The fruits on the table are all yours.
